    "Fed/fasted and formulation effects on the query are not assessed."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L6 hepatic-clearance records show low-to-moderate intrinsic clearance for related pyridine/pyrimidinone/guanine-like molecules and no high first-pass liability, reinforcing the prior high prediction. Combined with predominantly high human F in structurally related L1 contexts and favorable absorption/efflux evidence, F >= 20% remains better supported; confidence is moderate because all evidence is indirect and no direct query F is available."
}

